---
---

<section id="stones" class="relative px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <p class="mb-8 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-accent uppercase">The Principle</p>

    <div class="relative mb-12 overflow-hidden border border-border bg-surface">
      <img
        src="/stones.png"
        alt="Six glowing capability markers arranged in a constellation"
        class="h-auto w-full object-cover opacity-90"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-base/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
      One rare capability each.<br />
      <span class="text-accent">Shared across the room.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      <p>
        Every member walks in with one thing they do exceptionally well —
        a distribution engine that actually works, a hiring instinct that lands A-players,
        a sales motion that closes, a fundraising network that opens doors. The kind of
        thing you can't fake and can't rush.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="text-text font-semibold">Alone, any of these is powerful. Together, they compound.</span>
        One operator's blindspot is another's home turf. What took you a month,
        someone else already solved last Tuesday.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="text-text font-semibold">Access means hands-on.</span> You can ask any member
        to walk you through installing and running their system on your own machine, with the
        builder on the other end helping you get it working. Tutorials and demos are not the same thing.
        That's what membership grants you. That's what you grant in return.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
        <span class="block h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-accent shadow-[0_0_12px_2px_rgba(217,119,6,0.6)]"></span>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-text-muted uppercase">Distribution</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
        <span class="block h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-[#3b82f6] shadow-[0_0_12px_2px_rgba(59,130,246,0.6)]"></span>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-text-muted uppercase">Growth</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
        <span class="block h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-[#10b981] shadow-[0_0_12px_2px_rgba(16,185,129,0.6)]"></span>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-text-muted uppercase">Sales</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
        <span class="block h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-[#8b5cf6] shadow-[0_0_12px_2px_rgba(139,92,246,0.6)]"></span>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-text-muted uppercase">Hiring</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
        <span class="block h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-[#ef4444] shadow-[0_0_12px_2px_rgba(239,68,68,0.6)]"></span>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-text-muted uppercase">Fundraising</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 border border-border bg-surface p-5 transition-colors hover:border-accent/40">
        <span class="block h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-[#eab308] shadow-[0_0_12px_2px_rgba(234,179,8,0.6)]"></span>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wider text-text-muted uppercase">Ops</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
